           <p><strong>Q: What is the best time of year to visit Mauritius?</strong><br>A: May through September offers the most comfortable weather — cooler, drier, and outside cyclone season. The peak cruise season aligns with these months. November through March is warmer and more humid, with cyclone risk in January through March. Check the seasonal panel above for activity-specific recommendations.</p>
